==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|frm|en}} {{m|frm|grandeur}}, from {{etyl|fro|en}} {{m|fro|grandur}}, from {{m|fro|grant}}, from {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|grandis||grown up, great}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|/'ɡɹæn.dʒɚ/|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# The state of being [[grand]] or [[splendid]]; [[magnificence]].
# [[nobility|Nobility]].
# {{label|en|archaic|rare}} [[greatness|Greatness]]; [[largeness]]; [[tallness]]; [[loftiness]].

